cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "Can on-chain metrics predict Bitcoin and Cardano prices?"
abstract: >-
  A rigorous negative result: over 2020-2026 daily data, on-chain metrics carry
  no detectable incremental directional trading edge for BTC/ADA beyond price
  alone. Includes a controlled ablation, model-free statistical tests, a
  deep-learning capacity check, and a reusable methodology for evaluating crypto
  predictive claims.
type: software
